# Modes
i               Insert before cursor
a               Insert after cursor
o / O           New line below / above
v               Visual mode (characters)
V               Visual line mode
Ctrl-v          Visual block mode (columns)
Esc             Back to normal mode
:               Command mode

# Movement - basic
h / j / k / l   Left / down / up / right
w / b           Next / previous word
e               End of word
0               Start of line
^               First non-blank character
$               End of line
gg              Top of file
G               Bottom of file

# Movement - advanced
Ctrl-d / Ctrl-u   Half page down / up
{ / }             Previous / next paragraph
%                 Jump to matching bracket
fa              Jump to next 'a' on line (any char)
ta              Jump to before next 'a' on line
;               Repeat last f/t motion
* / #           Search word under cursor forward / backward

# Editing
x               Delete character
dd              Delete line
D               Delete to end of line
cc              Change line (delete + insert)
C               Change to end of line
yy              Yank (copy) line
p / P           Paste after / before cursor
u               Undo
Ctrl-r          Redo
.               Repeat last change
J               Join line below to current
>> / <<         Indent / dedent line

# Operators (combine with motions)
dw              Delete word
d$              Delete to end of line
cw              Change word
ci"             Change inside double quotes
ci(             Change inside parentheses
yap             Yank around paragraph

# Text Objects (use with d, c, y, etc)
iw / aw         Inner / around word
i" / a"         Inner / around double quotes
i' / a'         Inner / around single quotes
i( / a(         Inner / around parentheses
i{ / a{         Inner / around braces
i[ / a[         Inner / around brackets
ip / ap         Inner / around paragraph

# Search and Replace
/pattern        Search forward
?pattern        Search backward
n / N           Next / previous match
:s/old/new/     Replace first on line
:s/old/new/g    Replace all on line
:%s/old/new/g   Replace all in file
:%s/old/new/gc  Replace all with confirm
:noh            Clear search highlighting

# Registers and clipboard
"+y             Yank to system clipboard
"+p             Paste from system clipboard

# Macros
qa              Start recording macro to register a
q               Stop recording
@a              Play macro a
@@              Replay last macro

# Windows
Ctrl-w s        Split horizontal
Ctrl-w v        Split vertical
Ctrl-w h/j/k/l Navigate between windows
Ctrl-w q        Close window
Ctrl-w =        Equalize window sizes

# LazyVim - leader key is Space

# LazyVim - find (telescope)
Space ff        Find files
Space fg        Live grep (search in files)
Space fb        Find buffers
Space fr        Recent files
Space Space     Find files (alias)

# LazyVim - buffers
Shift-h         Previous buffer
Shift-l         Next buffer
Space bd        Delete buffer
Space bo        Delete other buffers

# LazyVim - file explorer (neo-tree)
Space e         Toggle file explorer
# Inside neo-tree:
#   a           Add file/directory (end with / for dir)
#   d           Delete
#   r           Rename
#   Enter       Open file

# LazyVim - code / LSP
gd              Go to definition
gr              Go to references
gI              Go to implementation
gy              Go to type definition
K               Hover documentation
Space ca        Code actions
Space cr        Rename symbol
Space cd        Line diagnostics
]d / [d         Next / previous diagnostic
Space cf        Format file

# LazyVim - terminal
Ctrl-/          Toggle terminal

# LazyVim - git
Space gg        Lazygit
Space gb        Git blame line
]h / [h         Next / previous hunk
Space ghp       Preview hunk
Space ghs       Stage hunk
Space ghr       Reset hunk

# LazyVim - UI toggles
Space un        Dismiss notifications
Space ul        Toggle line numbers
Space uw        Toggle word wrap
Space ud        Toggle diagnostics

# LazyVim - help
Space ?         Show all keymaps (which-key)

# Data monorepo plugins
# conform.nvim - auto formats on save:
#   BUILD / .bzl files -> buildifier
#   .py files -> ruff
# starlark.vim - syntax highlighting for BUILD / .bzl / .star
# yaml-companion - :YAMLCompanion to switch schema for K8s yamls
# treesitter grammars: starlark, python, proto, yaml, java

# Commands
:w              Save
:q              Quit
:wq             Save and quit
:q!             Quit without saving
:wa             Save all
:e file         Open file
:vs file        Open in vertical split
:Lazy           Plugin manager
:Mason          LSP/formatter installer
:TSInstall lang Install treesitter grammar
:checkhealth    Diagnose config issues
